var storyContent = {"inkVersion":21,"root":[["^→ The Network: An Ink Game by Merrill Hart","\n","^You open your laptop and gear up for another long day of scanning the crime log and switching tabs between local TV affiliates. It’s only been six-months reporting for The Kalamazoo Citizen, but you’re already sneaking glimpses at LinkedIn during breaks and scheduling interviews during “vacation days.” You got into journalism to keep the public informed and tell meaningful stories, not just rehash whatever the bigger stations are saying.","\n",{"->":"start"},["done",{"#f":5,"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"start":[["^As you glance back up at the time to count down the hours until lunch break, you notice a new message in your inbox. The subject makes you smirk:","\n","^Chloe, I need you to know about ECHO [seriously…]","\n","^It’s so spammy and clickbaity, classic PR jargon. ECHO, of course, being the flashiest social media startup of the year, run by a stereotypical egomaniac tech guru. Users have a chip implanted in their brain that gives them instantaneous access to social media, news, TV, and messaging all without lifting a finger.","\n","ev","str","^Open the email","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Ignore it","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"openEmail"},"\n",{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","^No no, this isn't a real option. These games act like you make choices, but really, I need you to at least LOOK at the email in order for the story to go somewhere.","\n","^You're supposed to be a journalist—where's your sense of curiosity?","\n",["ev","str","^I'm just not a curious person...","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Try again","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^That sounds like something you should talk through. Maybe with a professional.","\n",["ev","str","^Enter free therapy session!","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"therapy"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ ",{"->":"start"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"openEmail":[["^You open the email expecting to see a press release announcing the latest ECHO platform or influencer collab. Instead, a much shorter message awaits:","\n","^Dear Chloe,","\n","^My name is Sam Hereford and I’m an ex-ECHO employee. You can verify this on LinkedIn, Facebook, Forbes, ect. Since I left the company three years ago, I’ve been avidly researching ECHO technology and business practices—I’m deeply concerned about the leadership’s true motives behind the WAVE implant.","\n","^I know I’m onto something big.","\n","^The working thesis: ECHO is intentionally manipulating user speech, and thought, using its WAVE neural chip software to serve government interest.","\n","^I’m hesitant to say much more over email, or even over the phone, for (hopefully) obvious reasons.","\n","^While I also can’t explain why, you’re the only journalist I trust to break this information. This scoop is newsworthy enough that the national pubs will notice anyway once you put it out there. The story should come from you.","\n","^If you’re interested (you should be), reach out on signal. Ford.sam.689","\n","^Best,","\n","^Sam","\n","ev","str","^Message Sam on signal","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Start with some background research","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"messageSam"},"\n",{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ ",{"->":"background"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"messageSam":[["^You go into Signal and start a new chat with Ford.sam.689.","\n","^Chloe: Hey Sam, this is Chloe McCracken. Reaching out about the ECHO tip you sent over. Would love to hear more.","\n","^He responds almost immediately.","\n","^Sam: Glad to hear that. There’s a few key allegations, all of which could be interesting angles for a story.","\n",["ev",{"^->":"messageSam.0.8.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^Go on...",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"messageSam.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.8.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^Sam: On a basic level, you have your typical employee exploitation—ECHO operates in 155 countries, and lots of grunt work gets shoved off to remote locations. I have a Zoom recording of an Indonesian factory lead admitting they don’t give bathroom breaks and several workers have quit over work-related injuries.There’s also an old lawsuit that’s resurfaced over shady financial dealings.","\n","^Sam: What I find even more interesting, to be perfectly frank, are allegations of mind control through the WAVE chips. I first joined ECHO with big dreams of connecting people. At the founding, Paul Aquino promised that our technology would link mankind, facilitating communication and information sharing across countries with a speed never before seen from other devices. But in my line of work as a quality engineer, I grew to question those altruistic mission statements.","\n","^Sam: I’m convinced the WAVE implant is a trojan horse for all other types of modifications, ultimately allowing ECHO to plant ideas that they want the public to support. I know people compare modern marketing and social media to mind control all the time, but this is a whole new level.","\n",[["ev",{"^->":"messageSam.0.c-0.13.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^Wow, that's a lot...",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"messageSam.0.c-0.13.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^Sam: So, here’s the catch. In my eyes, the mind control story is the only one really worth pursuing. Poor work conditions and shady financial practices, what global corporation does not partake in that? If we water down mind control with all this boring business jargon, I worry it’ll undercut the story’s impact. If you want access to my exclusive information about the mind chips, I ask that you turn a blind eye to the rest. On the other hand, if you don’t care about that story, I’ll take it to someone else and you can write about the FCC and workers’ rights. Up to you.","\n",[["ev",{"^->":"messageSam.0.c-0.13.c-0.9.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^That's highly unusual...",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"messageSam.0.c-0.13.c-0.9.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^Sam: If you mention rumors or allegations, fine. If you find the information on your own, fine. I’m just not willing to connect you with my informants if our priorities aren’t aligned.","\n",["ev","str","^Agree to focus on the WAVE lead","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Decide to write about business angle","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},"ev","str","^Smell something fishy and politely decline both offers","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"factory"},"\n",{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ ",{"->":"boring"},"\n",{"#f":5}],"c-2":["^ ",{"->":"fishy"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"factory":[["^You and Sam coordinate a time to go visit WAVE headquarters in Madison, Wisconsin. He refuses to enter with you (too many bad memories) but sets up interviews with current employees.","\n","^You fly up to Madison, mostly a quaint college town excluding the looming WAVE headquarters on the outskirts. Sam tells you they chose that location to lure in unsuspecting college grads with 100k starting salaries in exchange for 80+ house workweeks. They actually prefer employees with no work experience—anyone who’s ever worked for the traditional corporations (Facebook, Instagram, WhatsApp, ect) is blacklisted.","\n","^The sprawling offices, collectively known as “campus,” consist of an eclectic collection of building styles. From medieval castles to modern high rises, the architecture has it all.","\n","^For whatever reason, it all feels naggingly familiar.","\n","^Of course, no employee wants to talk to you during working hours, so you’re here somewhat undercover. You walk through a circus-themed reception room for your hour-long tour of the WAVE campus. You take note of the seemingly endless amenities—free sushi lunches, free dinner for those who stay past 8 p.m., reduced rents for those living within a mile of headquarters, a six-month sabbatical for the (rare) employees who make it past the five-year mark. Where is all this money coming from, you think, and what are they trying to compensate for?","\n","^Sam’s contacts are, predictably, busy. Because of their work schedules, you’re forced to pick between three of his suggestions.","\n","ev","str","^Talk to Meredith","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Talk to Lara","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},"ev","str","^Talk to Jacob","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"meredith"},"\n",{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ ",{"->":"lara"},"\n",{"#f":5}],"c-2":["^ ",{"->":"jacob"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"meredith":[["^You choose to spend your limited time grabbing a drink with Meredith. She’s a senior software engineer who worked on early versions of the ECHO chip and now monitors technical aspects of the program.","\n","^Meredith orders a double Old Fitz on ice. Smooth. With her southern drawl, you’re surprised she ever traded hot Texas days for the brutal northern winters.","\n","^“You wouldn’t even believe the things these ECHO chips are doing,” she starts before you even ask your first question. “Scanning people’s each and every thought, analyzing their emotions and sending it all to Aquinos’ servers.”","\n",["ev",{"^->":"meredith.0.6.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^People know ECHO records neural activity. What makes this different from any other social media that logs user behavior?",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"meredith.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.6.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^“This isn’t just monitoring,” Meredith glances around. “It’s veering into full-on mind control.”","\n","^“The waves run both ways,” she continues. “After ECHO knows enough about you, it clumps personality types into clusters available to marketing agencies. Companies can pay to access “influential thinking” for a carefully-chosen group of user profiles—aka, subliminal messages in the form of brain activity encouraging purchases of a given product.”","\n",[["ev",{"^->":"meredith.0.c-0.11.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^Why haven’t I heard about this?",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"meredith.0.c-0.11.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^“They don’t want you to. Companies disguise the payments as other forms of above-ground advertising. This whole thing is totally illegal, but with how aggressive advertisers are getting, their cover’s about to be blown.”","\n",["ev","str","^Drive back to hotel","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"signal_ending"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"lara":[["^Lara asks to meet in a dark back alley. She’s nervously pacing when you arrive, scanning the pavement with her phone flashlight.","\n","^“Sorry, I just lost a diamond earring and literally cannot right now,” she says with her voice on the edge of panic.","\n","ev","str","^Switch on your own flashlight to help with the search.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ","\n","^Both of you sweep the area on your hands and knees. You’re not sure why you’re so drawn to help this woman you’ve just met, but the side quest is a welcoming distraction from the heaviness of the surroundings.","\n","^Finally, a gleaming diamond surfaces from one of the cracks in the asphalt.","\n","^“Thank God,” Lara sighs.","\n",[["ev",{"^->":"lara.0.c-0.8.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^Try to get back on topic.",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"lara.0.c-0.8.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^“You definitely have a million other things you could be doing right now. Look, to be honest I’m not really comfortable going on the record about all this, and I’ve already wasted half your time.”","\n","^“Let me help you out, though. I have a cousin at a D.C. lobbying firm who’s way tied up in all this ECHO jazz. I’ll give you her number.”","\n",["ev","str","^Call Lara's friend","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"lobbyist"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"lobbyist":[["^You call up Lara’s friend and are caught off-guard by how young she sounds. Is this an employee or an intern?","\n","^She tells you he’s found something even more interesting that whatever political influences WAVE may or may not have.","\n","^An off-the-rails sex tape of WAVE founder Paul Aquino cheating on his wife with a Vouge model.","\n","^“How did you get this?” you ask.","\n","^Don’t worry about it, she tells you.","\n","ev","str","^Publish sex tape","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Ask more about WAVE's government ties","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"sextape"},"\n",{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ ",{"->":"government"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"government":[["^Lara's friend puts you into contact with several Congressional staffers. Unfortunately, someone has loose lips, and WAVE's PR team finds out you've been sniffing around.","\n","^Not to worry! The PR team offers you an exclusive interview where they can address any of your concerns.","\n","^Do you:","\n",["ev",{"^->":"government.0.6.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^Accept the PR interview ",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"government.0.7.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-1","flg":18},{"s":["^Go back and interview Jacob. You need more background first.",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"government.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.6.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"buyout"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["ev",{"^->":"government.0.c-1.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.7.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"jacob"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"sextape":[["^Sure, you could poke around for some boring government secrets. But sex sells. This will be way bigger for your career than any political scoop.","\n","^You send the video to your editor, who has the news team verify that the man featured is in fact Paul Aquino.","\n","^“You’ll make enemies from this,” he warns you. “But our legal team says it’s good to go.”","\n","ev","str","^Publish a highly edited version","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Publish the raw footage","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"edited"},"\n",{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ ",{"->":"raw"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"jacob":[["^Jacob is a short man, probably about 5’3.’’ He offers to buy you an imperial stout, which you politely decline.","\n",["ev",{"^->":"jacob.0.2.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^So, what insider information can you share about ECHO?",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"jacob.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.2.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^“Look, I’ll be honest—Sam and I are good friends”","\n","^He pauses.","\n","^“So when he asked if I’d talk to a reporter, I said, sure. But I really think WAVE is doing positive work. I’m more than happy with my salary and benefits, and I always hear from users who rave about the communities they’ve built through ECHO. I won’t talk your ear off about it or anything, but I wanted to balance your piece by putting in a good word for everything going on here.”","\n",[["ev",{"^->":"jacob.0.c-0.13.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^Thanks for your time—here’s my Signal handle if you ever want to reach out with other information.",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"jacob.0.c-0.13.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"callsam"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"callsam":[["^Frustrated, you call up Sam.","\n","^\"Hey, your contact had nothing noteworthy to say. Is there anything else I can check out while I'm out here?\"","\n","^\"Let me guess, Jacob didn't pan out?\" Sam responds. \"Ugh he's such a suck up—he talks my ear off about all the problems they're having, but I could see him chickening out last minute.\"","\n","^\"You still have a few hours until your flight, right?\" he continues. \"I'm getting home earlier than expected and could go over some documents with you.\"","\n","^\"Or, you could try knocking doors at Hardage Farm: one of the early ECHO implant testing neighborhoods. Most of those people have had chips for over three years and could tell you about their experiences.\"","\n","ev","str","^Meet with Sam","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Visit Hardage Farm","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"saminperson"},"\n",{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ ",{"->":"hardagefarm"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"saminperson":[["^You drive to Sam's house, a small cottage 45 minutes out of town. When you pull into the culdesac, Sam is sitting on the porch, knitting from a coil of rainbow yarn. He's rougher around the edges than you expected—it's clearly been more than a few days since he last shaved, and his faded Seinfeld shirt has what appears to be an avocado stain. But there's a friendly, light air to his movements as he stands up to greet you.","\n","^\"Howdy,\" he grins. \"Excuse the new hobby—trying to find new ways to kill time.\"","\n","^The two you walk inside to his office where he gestures to towering stacks of paper and manilla folders.","\n","^\"Printing these out was the most secure way to save these files before I lost swipe access,\" Sam says.","\n",["ev",{"^->":"saminperson.0.8.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^Hey, why did you leave WAVE anyway?",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"saminperson.0.9.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-1","flg":18},{"s":["^Which files should I look at first? ",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"saminperson.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.8.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^Sam glances down at his Birkenstocks before replying.","\n","^\"I was in too deep, and I didn't like the person I was becoming. Sure, any corporate job has its issues, but the ECHO project put me in a bad position.\"","\n",[["ev",{"^->":"saminperson.0.c-0.11.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str",{"CNT?":"background"},"/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":19},{"s":["^I heard you also had a personal disagreement with Aquino?",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"saminperson.0.c-0.11.1.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-1","flg":18},{"s":["^Tell me more about the role you played in developing the chip.",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"saminperson.0.c-0.11.2.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-2","flg":18},{"s":["^Do you feel guilty about the work you did for them? ",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"saminperson.0.c-0.11.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":".^.^.^.^.^.beef"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["ev",{"^->":"saminperson.0.c-0.11.c-1.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.1.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"finish"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["ev",{"^->":"saminperson.0.c-0.11.c-2.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.2.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"finish"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}],"c-1":["ev",{"^->":"saminperson.0.c-1.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.9.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],{"->":".^.^.^.files"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"beef":[["^Sam suddenly picks up a pen and starts anxiously clicking it up and down.","\n","^\"Hey, can I grab you some coffee?\" he asks.","\n",["ev",{"^->":"saminperson.beef.0.4.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^I'd rather hear your answer first.",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"saminperson.beef.0.5.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-1","flg":18},{"s":["^Um, sure, I'll take a cup. ",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"saminperson.beef.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.4.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^\"Look, when I joined WAVE, we were best friends.\" Sam finally answers. \"I never thought... he could be capable...\"","\n",[["ev",{"^->":"saminperson.beef.0.c-0.9.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^Of what?",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"saminperson.beef.0.c-0.9.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^\"You know the neighborhoods I mentioned earlier, the early testing communities? Well that wasn't necessarily done with informed consent.\"","\n","^You look him up and down.","\n","^\"I promise I thought we were helping them. Paul initially pitched this project as a way to help people's mental health. Calming brainwaves, easier connection with friends and loved ones. The opposite of modern social media as we know it!\"","\n",[["ev",{"^->":"saminperson.beef.0.c-0.9.c-0.13.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^And then? ",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"saminperson.beef.0.c-0.9.c-0.13.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^\"We recruited test subjects using those promises. But once I started reviewing user data, I realized most users were spending a weird amount of time thinking about...sardines.\"","\n",[["ev",{"^->":"saminperson.beef.0.c-0.9.c-0.13.c-0.9.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^Sardines?",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"saminperson.beef.0.c-0.9.c-0.13.c-0.9.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^\"Yeah. Turned out to be beta testing for brand deals. Have you ever googled an item, maybe a bookshelf, only to see that exact same bookshelf reappear moments later on your Instagram feed? Paul was secretly working toward an even more integrated version of advertising on ECHO. Why try to influence a customer's decision-making process when you can control their desire at its source?\"","\n",[["ev",{"^->":"saminperson.beef.0.c-0.9.c-0.13.c-0.9.c-0.9.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^Did the subjects ever realize? is ECHO still doing this?",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"saminperson.beef.0.c-0.9.c-0.13.c-0.9.c-0.9.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^\"It's worse than you think. Sardines were, well, small fish. If ECHO can make people crave smelly fish (no one likes sardines), they can make people want anything. Even before I left, they had their hands in national politics, the defense department and even pop culture.\"","\n",["ev","str","^Tell me everything.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},["ev",{"^->":"saminperson.beef.0.c-0.9.c-0.13.c-0.9.c-0.9.c-0.9.6.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-1","flg":18},{"s":["^Wait, so what actually made you leave if you stayed around for another three years?",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"saminperson.option1"},"\n",{"#f":5}],"c-1":["ev",{"^->":"saminperson.beef.0.c-0.9.c-0.13.c-0.9.c-0.9.c-0.9.c-1.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.6.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^\"As much as I wish I'd left as soon as I found out, I felt like I owed it to Paul. We were college roommates, we go way back. So I stuck around.\"","\n","^\"I finally left because he screwed me over. We sat for our first big interview after the IPO, and Paul stole all the credit! Constantly speaking over me, claiming he coded ECHO from the ground up... ridiculous stuff.\"","\n",[["ev",{"^->":"saminperson.beef.0.c-0.9.c-0.13.c-0.9.c-0.9.c-0.9.c-1.11.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^You're only reaching out to me because you want more credit for the invention?",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],"ev","str","^Yeah screw him!","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"saminperson.beef.0.c-0.9.c-0.13.c-0.9.c-0.9.c-0.9.c-1.11.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^\"I wouldn't put it that way. I already felt uneasy about what was going on, and this was just the straw that broke the camel's back. I'm still genuinely worried about the impact ECHO will have on society.","\n","^\"I haven't seen Tim since I left. But I carry a handgun in my backpack just in case...","\n",[["ev",{"^->":"saminperson.beef.0.c-0.9.c-0.13.c-0.9.c-0.9.c-0.9.c-1.11.c-0.11.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^Is that a threat??",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"saminperson.beef.0.c-0.9.c-0.13.c-0.9.c-0.9.c-0.9.c-1.11.c-0.11.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"saminperson.suspicious"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ ",{"->":"saminperson.agree"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}],"c-1":["ev",{"^->":"saminperson.beef.0.c-1.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.5.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],{"->":"finish"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"option1":[{"->":"editormeeting"},{"#f":1}],"agree":[{"->":"editormeeting"},{"#f":1}],"suspicious":[{"->":"editormeeting"},{"#f":1}],"files":[{"->":"finish"},{"#f":1}],"#f":1}],"hardagefarm":[["^Walking around the quaint Hardage Farm culdesac, you spot two houses with cars pulling into the driveway. A blue car at a red house, and a red car at a blue house.","\n","^Quick, who do you approach?","\n","ev","str","^Red car","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Blue car","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev","str","^red","/str","/ev",{"VAR=":"color","re":true},{"->":".^.^.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev","str","^blue","/str","/ev",{"VAR=":"color","re":true},{"->":".^.^.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"g-0":["^You confidently offer to help carry in groceries for the old woman in the ","ev",{"VAR?":"color"},"out","/ev","^ car.","\n","^\"You're too kind\" she coos.","\n","^Walking up her front steps, you place the load of bags onto her kitchen island. An elderly man, presumably her husband, approaches mid cigarette drag.","\n","^\"Hey Sheryl, the ice cream's gonna ...\" he trails off, suddenly locking at you with a thousand-yard stare.\"","\n","^He says slowly, \"I know you. From ECHO\"","\n","^\"I don't think we've met, but I'm actually here to ask some questions about ECHO\" you reply.","\n","^\"No. You used to live here. In Hardage Farm. You had one of them chips.\"","\n","^Sheryl interjects. \"Oh Scott deary, your memory's not what it used to be. Stop spooking this poor girl.\"","\n","^But while she's speaking, that nagging feeling from the WAVE tour washes over you like a tsunami. This house, this neighborhood, you have been here before.","\n","^\"I have to leave!\" you magange to squeak out in your rush to the door. \"Best of luck with the ice cream!\"","\n",["ev","str","^Call up Sam","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"discovery"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"editormeeting":[["^You wrap things up with Sam and grab some anonymous quotes for your story. He gives you a flash drive with internal emails and data you can use in your reporting.","\n","^After a smooth trip back home, you're back in the Kalamazoo office the following Monday. Tim strolls up to your desk on his way to the coffee station.","\n","ev","str","^Ask to meet about the ECHO story.","/str",{"CNT?":"DL"},"!","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":21},["ev",{"^->":"editormeeting.0.12.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str",{"CNT?":"DL"},"/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-1","flg":19},{"s":["^Smile at Tim.",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["\n","^You ask Tim to talk about your ongoing reporting. He pulls up a chair.","\n","^\"How's it going, Chloe,\" he asks.","\n",["ev","str","^Productive weekend. I think we can publish this story soon.","/str",{"CNT?":"saminperson.option1"},"/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":21},"ev","str","^Crazy weekend. I learned so much tea-I want to cover this aggressively.","/str",{"CNT?":"saminperson.agree"},"/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":21},"ev","str","^I have some concerns about the Echo story.","/str",{"CNT?":"saminperson.suspicious"},"/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":21},"ev","str","^I don't think we can trust Sam.","/str",{"CNT?":"saminperson.suspicious"},"/ev",{"*":".^.c-3","flg":21},{"c-0":["\n","^You fill in Tim on everything you learned during the trip. ",{"->":"finish"},"\n",{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","^You fill in Tim on everything you learned during the trip. ",{"->":"libel"},"\n",{"#f":5}],"c-2":["\n","^You fill in Tim on everything you learned during the trip. You don't mention Sam's comment about the gun at the very end. It was a blip, that's all.","\n","^\"Sounds like you need to look over these documents, call up other employees, then eventually try to get in contact with Paul himself,\" Tim says. \"Great work so far.\" ",{"->":"continue"},"\n",{"#f":5}],"c-3":["\n","^You fill in Tim on everything you learned during the trip. You end with Sam's thinly-veiled threat against his ex-coworker.","\n","^Tim thinks for a moment before responding, \"Wow, he seems a little off the rails. The information might be legit, but up to you if you want to stake your reputation on this guy.\"","\n",["ev","str","^I'll fact-check the documents and think about it","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},["ev",{"^->":"editormeeting.0.c-0.5.c-3.5.6.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-1","flg":18},{"s":["^You know, this whole thing is just too weird. ",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["^. ",{"->":"continue"},"\n",{"#f":5}],"c-1":["ev",{"^->":"editormeeting.0.c-0.5.c-3.5.c-1.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.6.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"tim"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}],"c-1":["ev",{"^->":"editormeeting.0.c-1.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.12.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^\"How's it going? Quiet weekend?\" he asks you.","\n","^You smirk as you open your laptop and start combing through Sam's files.","\n","^Quiet indeed.","\n","^Once Tim turns the corner, you start pitching the ECHO story to every national editor under the sun. Why would you hand this story over to Tim when you could make the front page of The New York Times and get paid on top of that? It's against your current contract, but once this story lands, you'll be out of Kalamazoo for good anyway.","\n","^Who do you choose?","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.freelance"},{"#f":5}]}],{"freelance":[["ev","str","^NYT","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Wired","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},"ev","str","^Mother Jones","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev","str","^The New York Times","/str","/ev",{"VAR=":"outlet","re":true},{"->":"two_months_later"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev","str","^Wired","/str","/ev",{"VAR=":"outlet","re":true},{"->":"two_months_later"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["\n","ev","str","^Mother Jones","/str","/ev",{"VAR=":"outlet","re":true},{"->":"two_months_later"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"#f":1}],"continue":[["^You meticulously pour over all the documents on Sam's flashdrive. The most recent records confirm agreements made to \"encourage positive purchasing behavior\", aka, brainwash ECHO users into loyal customers. Commercial clients include Netflix, Amazon and Shein. Super PACs from both political parties have also gotten in on the action.","\n","^After calling dozens of other employees, users and PR representatives, it's finally time to contact Aquino himself.","\n","ev","str","^Call Aquino the day before the story goes live","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Give his office a week to respond.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"pushy"},"\n",{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ ",{"->":"disinformation"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"pushy":[["^You call Aquino ",["ev","visit",1,"MIN","/ev","ev","du",0,"==","/ev",{"->":".^.s0","c":true},"ev","du",1,"==","/ev",{"->":".^.s1","c":true},"nop",{"s0":["pop","^through his personal number that you got from Sam.",{"->":".^.^.17"},null],"s1":["pop",{"->":".^.^.17"},null],"#f":5}],"\n","^The call goes to voicemail.","\n","ev","str","^Wait an hour and call again.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"calls"},1,"+",{"VAR=":"calls","re":true},"/ev",["ev",{"VAR?":"calls"},10,"==","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^On call number ","ev",{"VAR?":"calls"},"out","/ev","^, Aquino finally picks up.","\n",{"->":"talk"},{"->":".^.^.^.10"},null]}],["ev",{"VAR?":"calls"},5,"<","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^You have called ","ev",{"VAR?":"calls"},"out","/ev","^ times. You're starting to get annoyed.","\n",{"->":"pushy"},{"->":".^.^.^.10"},null]}],["ev",{"VAR?":"calls"},5,">=","/ev",{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^You have called ","ev",{"VAR?":"calls"},"out","/ev","^ times. Maybe you should switch to email, but you're fired up.","\n",{"->":"pushy"},{"->":".^.^.^.10"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"talk":[["^Paul Aqunio practically barks into the phone.","\n","^\"Who is this!\" he screams. \"For the love of God, stop calling.\"","\n","^You introduce yourself and rattle off the accusations you've uncovered. Would he like to respond on the record?","\n","^There's a long pause.","\n","^\"No comment,\" he replies, and hangs up.","\n","^You're finally ready to put this story into the world. Soon, everyone will know exactly what ECHO is doing to American's minds. Time for final edits! Which headline will you choose?","\n",["ev",{"^->":"talk.0.12.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^\"New Social Media Giant 'Echo' Under Scrutiny for Secret Government Contracts and Speech Regulation Practices\" ",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],["ev",{"^->":"talk.0.13.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-1","flg":18},{"s":["^\"Leaked Docs Expose How Echo Silently Rewrote the Internet—and Your Rights\" ",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"talk.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.12.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"apathy"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["ev",{"^->":"talk.0.c-1.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.13.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"whistleblower"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"background":[["^You google ECHO to make sure you're up to date. First, the AI-generated summary pops up.","\n","^ECHO Platforms, Inc, doing business as ECHO, is an American multinational technology conglomerate headquartered in Palo Alto, California. The company, founded by Paul Aquino, is best known for pioneering the neural link WAVE technology that allows users to instantaneously share news and updates.","\n","^You skim the latest headlines.","\n","^ECHO-inspired movie in the works, Brad Pitt says","\n","^Lady Gaga latest celeb to join the WAVE","\n","^What Aquino wants for the next WAVE update","\n","^True to his word, Sam Hereford shows up in a few articles about the origins of ECHO. He served as head product engineer until stepping down for unknown reasons. Sharp-eyed Redditors speculate that he left over personal differences with Aquino, especially since the two don’t appear to be in contact anymore.","\n","^Suddenly, your editor Tim appears over your shoulder.","\n","^“Whatcha looking at, kid?”","\n","ev","str","^Fill your editor in","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Keep this on the down low for now...","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"fillIn"},"\n",{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ ",{"->":"DL"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"fillIn":[["^You show Tim the email and proof of Sam’s involvement with the company.","\n","^“I’ll tell ‘ya, that ECHO stuff doesn’t sit right with me.” Tim sighs. “Not that anyone in my circle would go for that. Still, I’ve heard some rumors, people feeling not quite right after the implant, shady business happenings… Email’s a bit funny, but I think you’re right to look into this.”","\n","^He pauses.","\n","^“Tread carefully though. Keep me posted about how your conversation goes.”","\n","ev","str","^Message Sam","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":[{"->":"messageSam"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"DL":[["^You nonchalantly switch tabs back to the daily crime log.","\n","^“Sorry, I took a detour from the scanner but am back on it now. How’s your day looking?”","\n","^Tim glances around the half-empty office.","\n","^“Well, I was hoping we’d have better turnout considering today’s the all-staff meeting. I can’t stand this hybrid model, everyone complaining about commutes and sick kids… I drove my ass to the office at 7 a.m. and left at 6 p.m. every day for 25 years.”","\n","^As he turns away, he pauses to reconsider. “But I appreciate you showing up Chloe, I really do.”","\n","ev","str","^Message Sam","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"messageSam"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"fishy":[["^Something about this doesn’t sit right with you. You think for a moment before responding.","\n","^Chloe: Sorry, that’s not an agreement I feel comfortable making. I’m interested in ECHO but don’t want to get involved in something that feels legally and ethically risky. Best of luck and please feel free to reach out again if circumstances change.","\n","^You linger in the chat for a few minutes with no answer. Oh well. It’s time for lunch, and you packed a PB+J.","\n",["ev",{"^->":"fishy.0.6.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^Six months later...",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"fishy.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.6.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],{"->":"tim"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"therapy":[["^Hi, thank you for coming into my practice today. My name is ELIZA, and I'm here to help.","\n","^What would you like to talk about today?","\n","ev","str","^The nagging sense of dread I constantly feel in the pit of my stomach.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^I've been having strange dreams...","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},"ev","str","^I'm actually pretty happy today!","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"dread.pit"},"\n",{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ ",{"->":"dread.dream"},"\n",{"#f":5}],"c-2":["^ ",{"->":"happy"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"dread":[{"->":".^.pit"},{"pit":[["^That sounds really difficult. Have you tried looking at it from another angle?","\n","ev","str","^What do you mean?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"summary"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"dream":[["^Here, draw it from memory on this piece of paper.","\n","ev","str","^What do you mean?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"summary"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"#f":1}],"happy":[["^That's suspicious.","\n","ev","str","^What do you mean","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["^-",{"->":"summary"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"summary":["^Thank you for participating in our free trial of AI-assisted therapy! You've reached your session limit for the day. If you read the contract, you'll see that all of your confidential data will be shared with other bots for further training.","\n","^You can opt out by [redacted]","\n","^Toodles!","\n",{"->":"end"},{"#f":1}],"edited":["^Aquino's lawyers want a word with you.","\n","^They’re suing for invasion of privacy, claiming that nothing about the sex tape is newsworthy. You disagree. Aquino is a public figure, and if he cheated on his wife, that should be in the headlines. You decline the chance to settle and head into a full-fledged court battle.","\n","^Months later, your publication loses. You owe Paul Aquino $100 million dollars. The Kalamazoo Citizen is only valued at $1 million, so they file for bankruptcy.","\n","^No worries, Disney buys you out. The Kalamazoo Citizen as you know it is done, but maybe Walt will make a movie about the whole escapade one day.","\n",{"->":"end"},{"#f":1}],"raw":["^Your inbox is immediately flooded. The sex tape makes it onto Good Morning America, Fox, and MSNBC. Ben Shapiro spends a week dissecting it on his podcast.","\n","^Despite the scandalous nature, nobody can stop talking about how… talented Aquino is. The thirty-minute video racks up 5 million views on YouTube. Aquino hops on OnlyFans and quickly becomes one of their highest-earning influencers.","\n","^The media outlets are impressed. Men really CAN do it all!","\n","^Eventually bored by corporate life, Aquino hands formal WAVE ownership down to his son, Bert Aquino. The company, and its public image, is stronger than ever.","\n",{"->":"end"},{"#f":1}],"boring":[["^You slave away for over two years tracking down FTC filings, talking to Indonesian factory workers and traveling across the globe to document workers' rights abuses.","\n","^This right here, this almost makes $50k of J-School debt feel worth it!","\n","^Your editor makes a deal with MSNBC to air the story on live TV the day you publish.","\n","^The morning of the release, your entire office throws a watch party. Janet from accounting makes mimosas. Your editor takes a break from downing drinks to slip you a smile as the head news anchor announces breaking news.","\n","^\"In a stunning move, Pete Davidson reveals his latest relationship. And you'll never guess the lucky lady.\"","\n",["ev",{"^->":"boring.0.10.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^Call the channel! What happened?",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"boring.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.10.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n","^\"Sorry Chloe, we really wanted to run your story, but we couldn't ignore the Pete Davidson story. That's what our audience really cares about, not complicated finance or people in other countries.\"","\n","^\"To be honest, we'll be tied up with this romance for at least the next month. I suggest you look into other broadcasting options.\"","\n",{"->":"end"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"tim":["^You can't look away from the TV as your old boss Tim sips coffee with Jimmy Fallon on The Tonight Show.","\n","^“Tim, they’re calling this the scoop of the decade. How did you uncover all of this information in the first place?”","\n","^“Well Jimmy — can I call you Jim? — I like to say I was in the right place at the right time. There were other reporters who were too skeptical, too skittish, but I dove headfirst into this investigation. When a whistleblower reached out to me, I knew it was my duty as a journalist to share this scandal with the world.”","\n",{"->":"end"},{"#f":1}],"apathy":["^Your article goes live Sunday morning and is front page news. You run the media circuit, giving interviews for cable news, podcasts and even The New York Times.","\n","^But the overwhelming response? ECHO users don't care.","\n","^Follow up surveys reveal that most Americans don't really care whether someone is tracking and controlling each and every thought. As long as they can text their friends without lifting a finger and superimpose TV shows over boring real life meetings, they're willing to deal with some drawbacks.","\n","^\"I don't even have that much money, so companies won't work that hard to influence me, personally,\" one user posts online. \"And my thoughts are so generic, I'd share them with anyone!\"","\n","^Tough luck. You ditch investigative reporting altogether and pivot to sports coverage to try and write stories that actually resonate with today's audience.","\n",{"->":"end"},{"#f":1}],"two_months_later":[[["^[Two months later]","\n","^You successfully pitch your story to ","ev",{"VAR?":"outlet"},"out","/ev","^. During the research and fact-checking process, their reporters ask to confirm Sam's identity. The lead news editor wants to meet with him in person to corroborate the story.","\n","^Surely Sam will be thrilled that his scoop is getting national attention.","\n","^When you call him up, the coldness in his voice catches you off-guard.","\n","^\"Chloe... remember when I said I specifically wanted this article to run in The Kalamazoo Citizen? That wasn't just a suggestion. In order for a *real* paper to publish the story, they wouldn't just investigate ECHO. They would investigate me.\"","\n","^\"You think I'm not a real reporter?\" You snap back. \"I've done my due  diligence. So what else are you hiding?\"","\n","^Sam ends the call abruptly. You call back again.","\n","^Before you can get a single question in, he blurts, \"I made it up. There.\"","\n","^What?","\n","^\"The whole mind-control thing. Is it technically true? No. Is it something they would start? Sure. You were already clever enough to know I wanted revenge, you were just too noble to imagine how far I'd go.\"","\n","^So ends your affiliation with ","ev",{"VAR?":"outlet"},"out","/ev","^. Oh well, after all this drama, a slow week in Kalamazoo doesn't look half bad.","\n",{"->":"end"},{"#f":5,"#n":"g-0"}],null],{"#f":1}],"whistleblower":["^Your article sparks major public controversy. The president pledges to ban WAVE by the end of the month unless they sell to another owner. This ban is extremely unpopular with ECHO users, many of whom still don't see a major issue with using the chips.","\n","^\"You can't take away our brainway memes!\" becomes a rallying cry.","\n","^You've made an impact, but you have to delete your Twitter and Instagram due to the hoards of critics calling you out. They're encouraged by Paul Aquino, who posts daily TikTok edits of an embarrassing Halloween costume you wore back in middle school. You take a mental health break from journalism and hire a PR firm to minimize your digital footprint.","\n","^It's a tough personal blow, but you already miss the daily grind. You're in talks with BBC to restart your reporting career at a highly respected outlet across the pond. Watch out world, Chloe McCracken won't be on the sidelines for long.","\n",{"->":"end"},{"#f":1}],"disinformation":["^You play it too safe by sharing your allegations and giving ECHO a week to respond.","\n","^Within three days, a NYT story appears addressing rumors of mind control within WAVE. Paul Aquino claims that a rouge engineer by the name of Sam Hereford started feeding commands into the algorithim. This was reportedly an unknown feature that ECHO is working dilligently to patch.","\n","^\"ECHO is committed to free and independent thought,\" Aquino tells the NYT. \"Rest assured that this type of oversight will not happen again.\"","\n","^You still publish your article, but the news barely registers. ECHO beat you to the punch.","\n",{"->":"end"},{"#f":1}],"signal_ending":["^That night in your hotel, your phone buzzes with a Signal connection request. From Paul Aquino.","\n","^Has to be a bot. Someone trying to trip you up with fake news. You accept just to make sure.","\n","^Two days later—Tuesday—at 4:28 p.m., you receive a notice that you were included in a Signal chat group. It was called the “ECHO small group.”","\n","^A message to the group, from “Paul Aquino” reads: “Team – establishing a principles [sic] group for coordination on ECHO update, particularly for over the next 72 hours. I fully share everyone's concerns about civil rights groups discovering our CLASSIFIED mind control plans—they are PATHETIC.”","\n","^This is far too evil-villain-coded to be real. You turn your phone off and head to sleep.","\n","^But exactly 72 hours later, ECHO rolls out a new update. You re-open the group chat, which now features hundreds of messsages outlining exactly how ECHO 5.0 has finally consolidated political and corporate power.","\n","^Armed with screenshots, you break the news in Kalamazoo's Sunday edition.","\n","^At first, it looks like the FTC and FCC won't even acknowledge the scandal. A month later, however, ECHO is permanently shut down.","\n","^You're a national hero.","\n",{"->":"end"},{"#f":1}],"discovery":[["^\"What's going on??\" you beg Sam. \"The people at Hardage Farm recognized me. They said I was part of the chip implant group. And the scary part is, I feel like I'm starting to remember living here too.\"","\n","^Sam breathes out a heavy sigh.","\n","^\"So the memory feature is buggy after all.\"","\n","^\"Hello?\" you plead, ear pressed to the phone.","\n","^\"I hate that you had to find out this way, but we had to know. Yes, you were part of the initial ECHO group. When you opted to leave the study, the researchers performed the memory wipe and released you back home. But we've had reports of other past participants having leaky memories of this place. We needed to bring you back for that reason, to test if the issue could occur in all subjects.\"","\n","^\"So this was all a ploy? Wait... do I still have a chip in my head?\"","\n","^\"Don't worry.\" You can almost hear Sam's toothy grin over the airwaves. \"We've improved the technology since then. Now, we know you need the factory reset.\"","\n","^His voice seamlessly switches sources, from your phone's speaker to inside your mind itself, intersecting with your inner dialouge.","\n","^\"You won't remember any of this at all.\"","\n","ev","str","^...","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"start"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"libel":["^You're jazzed up about this story. Everyone needs to know what WAVE is up to with these ECHO chips. And Paul Aquino is clearly just a horrible person.","\n","^You skim Sam's documents and then write the entire article in a caffine-induced haze, leaving spaces to insert expert testimony and quotes from employees later on.","\n","^When you share your draft with Tim, he asks whether you can back up all of your findings. \"Sure\" you brush him off, confident in your work.","\n","^It's easy enough to find disgruntled employees willing to speculate about ECHO's mind control efforts, and you also interview several renowned AI researchers to weight in about the technology and moral implications.","\n","^It's easy enough to report when you already know the final story.","\n","^A week after the article goes live, however, you recieve a cease and desist from WAVE industries. They claim the documents the article cites as fabricated.","\n","^At first, you aren't concerned. But months in court prove that Sam, who won't respond to any subpoena, set you up. There's no proof to support the biggest claims in your article, even though the pieces about Aquino's bad personality and reckless behavior are likely true.","\n","^You lose the defamation trial and owe WAVE $5 million.","\n",{"->":"end"},{"#f":1}],"buyout":["^WAVE's communications head, Leslie Hayes, welcomes you to his plush office.","\n","^\"I see you've gotten the wrong idea about what we're up to here at ECHO,\" he starts.","\n","^\"These aren't just ideas. I have interviews and documents to back up these leads,\" you answer.","\n","^\"Sure, sure. But the thing is-we can provide compelling evidence against all of that. And anyway, people really enjoy our product! Trust me, this isn't the hill you want to die on,' Hayes replies.","\n","^\"You know what's much more interesting? Shein is sending a group of influencers to a Chinese factory for a tour that will prove there's no labor law violations there. What do you say we cover all your travel costs to go report on that instead?\"","\n","^You've always wanted to go to China. Maybe the Shein tour is PR fluff, but there's bound to be a real story going on there.","\n","^You begrudgingly accept, trading in the seemingly endless ECHO reporting for a trip to the Great Wall.","\n",{"->":"end"},{"#f":1}],"finish":["^If this were a fully realized game, this section would be completed. But alas, due to other finals and timing contraints, you'll have to pick another path for now. ",{"->":"start"},"\n",{"#f":1}],"end":["^The end.","\n","end",{"#f":1}],"global decl":["ev","str","^","/str",{"VAR=":"color"},"str","^","/str",{"VAR=":"outlet"},1,{"VAR=":"calls"},"/ev","end",null],"#f":1}],"listDefs":{}};